ics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Explosive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Explosive\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Explosive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Fire> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#ElementalType> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Game\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Grass> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#ElementalType> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#HealingConsumable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#HealingConsumable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Healing consumable\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#HealingConsumable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Anything that can cross from one game into another: a tool, a consumable, a creature.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Item\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Normal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://tesseractsemantics.c